{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A dizzying fish fest in a seaweed-drunk town of the deep blue: <strong>Bloop</strong>. In this 6\u201310 player underwater spy game, each dive gives you a new identity to experience the thrilling tension of cooperation and betrayal. In the blink of an eye, you build trust, pick up on silent clues, and write a surprise-filled underwater story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each round, you take on one of three distinct roles:<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465050/extras/masum.png?t=1746283235\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Innocent Fish</strong>: guardians of the town\u2019s fragile peace, dive deep into the currents of suspicion\u2014interrogating their own to unmask the hidden traitors beneath the surface.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465050/extras/hain.png?t=1746283235\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Traitor Fish</strong>: Earn the innocents\u2019 trust before striking at the critical moment\u2014sabotaging systems and slipping away into the underwater darkness without a sound.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465050/extras/tarafs\u0131z.png?t=1746283235\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Neutral Fish</strong>: Pledge allegiance to no one, using whispers and rumors to upend the game\u2019s flow; you wait for the perfect moment to seize power and tip the scales.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">By blending deception, teamwork, and fierce competition, <strong>Bloop</strong> reveals your true underwater self at the end of every round. Ready to wag your tail? Dive into the most entertaining intrigue the deep blue has to offer!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackgr