ness without a sound.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465050/extras/tarafs\u0131z.png?t=1746283235\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Neutral Fish</strong>: Pledge allegiance to no one, using whispers and rumors to upend the game\u2019s flow; you wait for the perfect moment to seize power and tip the scales.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">By blending deception, teamwork, and fierce competition, <strong>Bloop</strong> reveals your true underwater self at the end of every round. Ready to wag your tail? Dive into the most entertaining intrigue the deep blue has to offer!</p>","developers":["Ducktastic"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465050/32c4c400fae4a771acef17a35d228953e20d38da/header.jpg?t=1746283235","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257131428,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257131428/movie480.mp4?t=1746283233","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257131428/movie_max.mp4?t=1746283233"},"name":"Bloop","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257131428/d671cdcfdd9557ebcb3c501a2812af4eab88fba4/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1746283233","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257131428/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1746283233","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257131428/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1746283233"}